error[E4104]: cannot use `c.value` while it is mutably borrowed
  --> tests/borrows/fail/E4104_read_while_mutably_borrowed.tarn:37:10
   |
36 |     m := &mut c
   |          ------ mutable borrow of `c` starts here
37 |     v := c.value              // plain read of a copy field
   |          ^^^^^^^ used here
38 |     bump(m)
   |          - the borrow is still used here
   |
   = note: a borrow lasts until the last use of the reference that holds it

